              "content": "Inventory: desktop sidebar X:PV1ln; phone header KthOL; auth expiry/private purge OwZka; interrupted read recovery rD02Q; retained original file xD63J/KVIG2 and diff Mn97J; Markdown pUX8f/bz4VC; raster/PDF JCGmX/MKzws/FCvHl. No dedicated account-settings, guided-login or retained-HTML viewer composition. Their routes/recovery obligations remain in the SPEC. No context-menu, extension or notification route is added.",
