              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "List / Board change presentation only. AT-155 is the running cold-start task; its latest check failed, Eli's check-repair assignment A-108 is recorded, and no operator request is recorded. Document retry policy stays Waiting with the operator choosing retry limits and Jonas as lead. The All-projects Board keeps readiness separate from execution: dependency-held Ready tasks appear in Waiting, and Q-204/r2 remains Paused until separately resumed. All three Q-204 answers submit together; Q2's three selected choices exceed the 1–2 limit, so Submit answers stays disabled. The phone frame shows the Q2–Q3 scroll position while retaining Q1 above. Measure the responsive navigation threshold and textarea growth cap in implementation; assign scrolling to the body/queue viewport and preserve selection/caret across resize. Keyboard/focus order and focus before submission, forced-colour contrast, scrollbar chaining, safe-area and virtual-keyboard behavior, and physical-device resize/zoom/text scale need browser/device evidence. Comparison-image loading remains unverified.",
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
